  message: "Code merged in PR #1606 (ee7dcb505c): Edge.create(resolution_score=) via confidence.derive_resolved_confidence (endpoints exact; errors for both kwargs / is_resolved=False / unseeded pathway); 87 base x grade sites migrated; 12 pathways seeded at their exact-match base; static call labels fixed (glsl, hlsl, nix, wgsl, fortran, R); js_ts scope-bound / explicit-import now grade 1.0 -> 0.85. Production-path evidence: test_c.py::TestCResolutionConfidence (exact cross-file call 0.85 evidence_derived, was 0.95; ambiguous call in band), test_js_ts_bare_name_scope_binding (position-proven bind 0.85, was 0.90), test_confidence.py interpolation tests (exact/suffix/ambiguous for n=2..59 all in band, ordering preserved). STILL OPEN: the item's named close evidence -- a self-survey with check-self-tree-validation exiting 0 -- has not been run (owner asked to be consulted before hypergumbo runs on a big repo). The full-suite self-tree-validation job on ee7dcb505c or later will provide it."  # f2eb
